# 08 — 客户端/服务端分离

> 适用版本：Forge 1.13.2

---

## 物理端注解

| 注解 | 含义 |
|------|------|
| `@OnlyIn(Dist.CLIENT)` | 仅在客户端运行 |
| `@OnlyIn(Dist.DEDICATED_SERVER)` | 仅在服务端运行 |

## Dist 检查

```java
DistExecutor.unsafeRunWhenOn(Dist.CLIENT, () -> () -> clientMethod());
DistExecutor.unsafeRunWhenOn(Dist.DEDICATED_SERVER, () -> () -> serverMethod());
```
